        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over time, we have invested in and developed various technologies that allow us to put physical product closer to the point of use in a customer location, increase the visibility of a customer's supply chain (to the customer as well as our personnel), and/or improve the ability to monitor or control usage.",
        "start_character": 7606,
        "end_character": 7913
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This product line has seen significant sales growth in the last 10 years, which we believe is directly attributable to our success cross-selling safety supplies to customers that utilize us for non-safety products, as well as our ability to market, deploy, and service industrial vending over that period.",
        "start_character": 28687,
        "end_character": 28992
      },
      {
