        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Today we sell a broader range of industrial and construction supplies spanning more than nine major product lines through a global network of locations utilizing diverse technologies such as vending devices, bin stock devices, and eBusiness.",
        "start_character": 633,
        "end_character": 874
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also believe our FMI solutions, supported by our selling locations, provide a unique way to serve our customers with convenient access to products and cost saving solutions using a business model not easily replicated by our competitors.",
        "start_character": 45016,
        "end_character": 45256
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that better service, and a competitive selling advantage, can be provided by maintaining a physical selling and stocking presence closer to the customers' location(s).",
        "start_character": 44451,
        "end_character": 44629
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the combination of our broad product offering, physical presence on a global scale, and toolbox of services, specialists, and digital capabilities, produces a customer engagement model that is difficult for large and small competitors to replicate.",
        "start_character": 19721,
        "end_character": 19980
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
        "accession_number": "0000815556-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct business under various trademarks and service marks, and we utilize a variety of designs and taglines in connection with each of these marks, including Where Industry Meets Innovation™.",
        "start_character": 25676,
        "end_character": 25872
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000815556-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000815556-26-000009-2b991a99593936f2",
